{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t生產力促進局設立香港首個專注於具身智能及人形機械人實景應用的訓練場。創新科技及工業局局長孫東表示，期望通過訓練場，推動更多全球應用的成功案例。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n另外，金管局推動銀行業負責任地應用人工智能，公布最新的框架。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.147464+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:48:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:39.526356+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:45.450638+00:00","content_hash":"df99aea767fa9f58e4e438e946231684ff2d6cec9569e3ac11f1263d48b0bfa3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}